    And Noto is ready at <noto> seconds
    Then the loading screen goes away at <exit> seconds

    Examples:
      | auth | atkinson | noto | exit   |
      | 0.1  | 0.2      | 30   | 0.5    |
      | 0.1  | 3        | 30   | 3      |
      | 4    | 0.1      | 30   | 4      |
      | 0.1  | 0.6      | 0.1  | 0.6    |
      | 0.1  | 30       | 0.1  | 10     |
      | 12   | 30       | 30   | 12     |

